   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 250eb (Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>Kiroshi, the continued leaders in cutting edge cyberoptics, have produced a new hardware upgrade for their existing models that provides greater customization than any competitor’s offerings.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Cybereye Enhancement.</strong> Adds one Option Slot to the cybereye. May appear like a regular eye, unless the cybereye enhanced is Borgware.</p>\n<p><em>NOTE: Credit to the From the Ashes LC for the idea on changes to this item.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Cybereye<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The extra Option Slot is applied automatically.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberoptics).</em></p>"
